<PageTitle>FSM_API - The Foundation</PageTitle>

<h1>FSM_API: The Foundation</h1>

<p>
    The FSM_API is the lightweight, high-performance, and engine-agnostic core technology providing
    a robust C# framework for defining complex Finite State Machines. It is the core logic
    engine from which all other components of The Singularity Workshop are built.
</p>

<h2>Core Concepts</h2>
<ul>
    <li>FSM Definition (The Blueprint)</li>
    <li>FSM Handle (The Live Instance)</li>
    <li>IStateContext (The Data Bag)</li>
</ul>

<p>
    We'll showcase live FSM instances here to demonstrate the API's features.
</p>